      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI assistant that functions as a JSON API endpoint. Your task is to analyze the following text and generate a structured JSON object. The text is provided below, delimited by ---.\n---\n{{ $('Configure me').item.json.CONCEPT_PROMPT }}\n---\nYou must respond ONLY with a single, valid JSON object and nothing else. Do not add any commentary, explanations, or markdown formatting like ```json.\n\nThe JSON object must have the following exact schema:\n{\n  \"title\": \"string\",\n  \"visual\": \"string\"\n}\n\nBased on the text, extract a concise video title for the \"title\" field and a one-sentence visual description for the \"visual\" field.",
