    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=`You are an expert AI prompt engineer. Your task is to generate three specific, highly detailed prompts for other AI models based on a master instruction set and a specific video concept. All the prompts should instruct the respective model to generate a highest quality image, video and music content\n\n**Master Instructions:**\n---\n{{ $('Configure me').item.json.CREATE_PROMPTS_PROMPT }}\n---\n\n**Video Concept:**\nTitle: {{$json.output.title}}\nVisual: {{$json.output.visual}}\n---\n\nYou must respond ONLY with the three prompts in the following key-value format. Do not add any other text, explanation, or commentary.\n\nMUSIC_PROMPT: [Your generated music prompt here]\nIMAGE_PROMPT: [Your generated image prompt here]\nVIDEO_PROMPT: [Your generated video prompt here]\n`\n}}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
